WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:01.968
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:02.968
"The Tonight Show"!

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:04.203
You're here! You made it!

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:05.337
Thank you for watching.

00:00:05.337 --> 00:00:07.707
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:10.310
Well, it seems like there's
so much going on right now.

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:14.814
Tropical depression Henri
is still hitting the Northeast,

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:17.283
NBA champs the Seattle Storm

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:19.252
visited Biden
at the White House,

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:22.989
the pumpkin spice latte is back,

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:26.292
and a woman found nuts and bolts
in her Domino's pizza.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:27.827
[ Laughter ]
There's a lot to go over,

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:29.529
so let's just jump in
and cover it all at once.

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:31.030
It's time for a "News Mash."

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:36.635
[ Cheering and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:36.635 --> 00:00:40.205
First up, the WNBA champions
the Seattle Storm.

00:00:40.205 --> 00:00:42.041
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:44.310
They visited President Biden
today and get this --

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.178
they're the first WNBA team

00:00:46.178 --> 00:00:49.214
to be invited to the White House
since 2015.

00:00:49.214 --> 00:00:51.951
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:53.319
It's a pretty big deal.

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.988
Speaking of storms
that are a pretty big deal,

00:00:55.988 --> 00:00:57.390
tropical depression Henri.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.092
[ Laughter ]
Over the weekend,

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:02.061
45 million people were
under a tropical storm warning,

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:04.864
so, last week, things on the
East Coast were hot and sticky

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:06.832
and, this week,
things were just wet.

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:08.267
[ Laughter ]
And if you want something

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:10.769
that's just hot, wet,
and sticky, why not try

00:01:10.769 --> 00:01:12.972
Starbucks' pumpkin spice latte?

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:15.408
[ Laughter and applause ]
It's back.

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:17.643
Starting tomorrow.

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:19.278
Some people are excited,
while others think

00:01:19.278 --> 00:01:21.247
it's too early
for pumpkin spice.

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:23.282
Either way, drinking one
is way better than

00:01:23.282 --> 00:01:26.819
eating a pizza covered
in nuts and bolts.

00:01:26.819 --> 00:01:29.389
A woman reportedly ate half
of her Domino's Pizza

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:31.791
before finding them
in her toppings.

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.026
Can you imagine digesting
all that cheese and metal?

00:01:34.026 --> 00:01:35.728
I mean, that would rock you
like a...

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:37.530
hurricane that was
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.798
downgraded
to a tropical depression.

00:01:39.798 --> 00:01:41.500
Sure, it doesn't feel good
to be demoted,

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:43.302
but keep your head up, Henri.

00:01:43.302 --> 00:01:45.838
[ Laughter ]
If you work hard
and do your best,

00:01:45.838 --> 00:01:47.440
you, too, can be the

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:49.309
Storm invited
to the White House.

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:51.978
[ Laughter ]
The team took pictures
with the Bidens

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:54.213
and, of course, a lot of the
players are taller than them.

00:01:54.213 --> 00:01:57.517
And, if you want something tall,
that's from Seattle, why not try

00:01:57.517 --> 00:01:59.852
Starbucks' pumpkin spice latte.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:59.852 --> 00:02:03.656
It's only five bucks
for a tall.

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:06.492
So, it'll be on the house,
if you

00:02:06.492 --> 00:02:08.494
find nuts and bolts in it.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.494 --> 00:02:09.896
If that woman sues Domino's,

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:11.330
she could probably
make a lot of money.

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:12.499
I bet she could even

00:02:12.499 --> 00:02:14.567
make it rain.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:16.535
Henri broke the record
for rainfall

00:02:16.535 --> 00:02:19.505
in one hour in New York,
which is nuts.

00:02:19.505 --> 00:02:21.240
And bolts.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.908
In conclusion,

00:02:22.908 --> 00:02:24.543
OMG,

00:02:24.543 --> 00:02:26.079
FYI,

00:02:26.079 --> 00:02:27.346
PSL!,

00:02:27.346 --> 00:02:28.680
FML.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:31.384
[ Cheering and applause ]
This has been a "News Smash."

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:33.552
♪♪

00:02:33.552 --> 00:02:37.890
[ Whistling ]
♪♪

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:39.391
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:39.391 --> 00:02:40.860
Thank you very much.
Wow.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.795
[ Applause ]

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:43.829
Here's some good news --

00:02:43.829 --> 00:02:45.397
today, the FDA granted

00:02:45.397 --> 00:02:48.066 line:0%
full approval
to Pfizer's COVID vaccine.

00:02:48.066 --> 00:02:54.173 line:0%
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:54.173 --> 00:02:55.641
It's about time!

00:02:55.641 --> 00:02:58.277
Their statement started with,
"Hey, sorry, I just saw this."

00:02:58.277 --> 00:03:03.415
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.415 --> 00:03:05.784
Yeah, it was approved
by the real FDA,

00:03:05.784 --> 00:03:07.619
the Food and Drug
Administration,

00:03:07.619 --> 00:03:09.922
which is not to be confused
with the fake FDA,

00:03:09.922 --> 00:03:11.690
the Facebook Doctors
Association.

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:13.159
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah!

00:03:13.159 --> 00:03:14.626
-Yeah, this is great news,
although,

00:03:14.626 --> 00:03:16.395
if it didn't get approved,
I'm not really sure

00:03:16.395 --> 00:03:17.664
what the options were.

00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:18.998
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.998 --> 00:03:20.500
Pfizer store credit?

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.067 --> 00:03:23.469
Must be weird,
working at the FDA.

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:25.705
One day, you're approving
a lifesaving vaccine;

00:03:25.705 --> 00:03:28.207
the next, you're approving
new S'mores-flavored Oreos.

00:03:28.207 --> 00:03:30.643
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:33.045
Get this -- Which I don't
believe is a real thing,

00:03:33.045 --> 00:03:35.047
but, if it is --
-If it isn't, it should be.

00:03:35.047 --> 00:03:38.017
-Yeah, I would -- yeah.
I'd get the shot and the cookie,

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:39.952
yeah, both.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.952 --> 00:03:43.889
Get this -- the new name of the
fully approved Pfizer vaccine is

00:03:43.889 --> 00:03:46.992
Comirnaty.

00:03:47.059 --> 00:03:49.294
[ Laughter ]
Comirnaty, which sounds more

00:03:49.294 --> 00:03:51.064
like a drunk person trying
to say, "Community."

00:03:51.064 --> 00:03:52.331
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.331 --> 00:03:53.365
[ Slurring words ]
You can't arrest me.

00:03:53.365 --> 00:03:55.834
I'm a valued member
of the community.

00:03:55.834 --> 00:03:59.205
[ Laughter ]
[ Hiccough ]

00:03:59.205 --> 00:04:00.440
[ Applause ]
But the vaccine isn't

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:02.241
the only thing keeping
the FDA busy.

00:04:02.241 --> 00:04:05.078
They recently had to tell people
not to treat COVID

00:04:05.078 --> 00:04:08.247
with a drug that's given
to animals with worms.

00:04:08.247 --> 00:04:10.049
[ Laughter ]
This is real. They tweeted...

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:17.757
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:17.757 --> 00:04:21.894
[ Rimshot ]

00:04:21.894 --> 00:04:23.529
Meanwhile, the people
taking it are like --

00:04:23.529 --> 00:04:24.964
[ Southern accent ]
Laugh all you want,
but I don't have COVID

00:04:24.964 --> 00:04:26.733
and the worms are
almost gone, so.

00:04:26.733 --> 00:04:29.134
[ Laughter ]

00:04:29.134 --> 00:04:30.370
Some entertainment news --

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.405
well, due to his past
offensive comments,

00:04:32.405 --> 00:04:35.641 line:0%
Mike Richards has stepped down
as host of "Jeopardy!",

00:04:35.641 --> 00:04:37.510 line:0%
after just one day of filming.

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:41.981 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:41.981 --> 00:04:46.185
Yeah, he was only the host
for five shows.

00:04:46.185 --> 00:04:48.654
Come on. Half the contestants
last longer than he did.

00:04:48.654 --> 00:04:50.256
[ Laughter ]

00:04:50.256 --> 00:04:51.757
That's right,
he's stepping down as host,

00:04:51.757 --> 00:04:55.994
but he'll remain as the show's
executive producer.

00:04:55.994 --> 00:04:57.496
Not a great look on his résumé.

00:04:57.496 --> 00:05:00.099
It's like having your jobs
listed as Wendy's cashier,

00:05:00.099 --> 00:05:02.135
Wendy's manager,
Wendy's cashier.

00:05:02.135 --> 00:05:04.870
[ Laughter ]

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:07.373
That's right, Mike Richards
has stepped down as host,

00:05:07.373 --> 00:05:10.610
but he's already taped
a week's worth of episodes.

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:11.877
Not surprisingly, the categories

00:05:11.877 --> 00:05:14.080
are pretty awkward.
Take a look.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:16.482 line:0%
-Here are the categories
in the Jeopardy! round...

00:05:16.482 --> 00:05:19.218 line:0%
♪♪

00:05:30.896 --> 00:05:31.998 line:0%
And, finally...

00:05:33.566 --> 00:05:35.267
[ Laughter ]

00:05:35.267 --> 00:05:36.369
-Interesting.

00:05:36.369 --> 00:05:39.271
[ Applause ]

00:05:39.271 --> 00:05:42.175
And, finally, inspired
by a recent TikTok trend,

00:05:42.175 --> 00:05:44.510
a Domino's in Australia
has unveiled

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:46.879
a unusual new menu item.
Take a look at this.

00:05:46.879 --> 00:05:49.214 line:0%
-Domino's is getting inventive.

00:05:49.214 --> 00:05:51.684 line:0%
Their Australian account
posted this video

00:05:51.684 --> 00:05:54.386 line:0%
of them creating
a new summer-themed pizza.

00:05:54.386 --> 00:05:57.122 line:0%
The crust is actually made

00:05:57.122 --> 00:05:58.657 line:0%
of watermelon.

00:05:58.657 --> 00:06:00.960 line:0%
It's topped with tomato sauce
and pepperoni.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:03.729 line:0%
[ Ewwing and laughter ]

00:06:03.729 --> 00:06:05.164
Honestly, I'd rather have
the pizza topped

00:06:05.164 --> 00:06:06.498
with nuts and bolts.

00:06:06.498 --> 00:06:08.433
Guys, whenever I get
some downtime here at the show,

00:06:08.433 --> 00:06:09.735
I like to go on Instagram

00:06:09.735 --> 00:06:11.336
and scroll
through all the photos

00:06:11.336 --> 00:06:13.138
and one thing I've noticed is
that, a lot of times,

00:06:13.138 --> 00:06:15.441
two people will write
the exact same caption,

00:06:15.441 --> 00:06:18.277
but the pictures they post
will be completely different.

00:06:18.277 --> 00:06:19.979
I'll show you what I mean
in this next segment.

00:06:19.979 --> 00:06:21.447
It's time for "Picture This."

00:06:21.447 --> 00:06:23.382
[ Cheering and applause ]
-♪ Picture this, picture this ♪

00:06:23.382 --> 00:06:24.750
♪ Picture this ♪

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.752
♪ Yeah, picture this ♪

00:06:26.752 --> 00:06:28.787
-Alright, let's take a look
at this first example.

00:06:28.787 --> 00:06:31.224
It's from Ariana Grande
and Bernie Sanders.

00:06:31.224 --> 00:06:33.459
[ Laughter ]

00:06:33.459 --> 00:06:34.560
They both wrote...

00:06:41.733 --> 00:06:43.602 line:0%
...the Gmail login screen.
-Oh.

00:06:43.602 --> 00:06:45.070 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:47.906 line:0%
-Hours.
-Hours?!

00:06:47.906 --> 00:06:49.641 line:0%
Just on the login screen.

00:06:49.641 --> 00:06:53.279 line:0%
-The next one is
from the CDC and the FDA.

00:06:53.279 --> 00:06:54.380 line:0%
They both wrote...

00:07:01.353 --> 00:07:02.621 line:0%
The pumpkin spice latte.

00:07:02.621 --> 00:07:06.092 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:07.393 line:0%
It's already here.

00:07:07.393 --> 00:07:11.430 line:0%
Next one's from the UFC
and Organic Valley.

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:13.099 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
They both wrote...

00:07:15.267 --> 00:07:16.469 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
-Oh. Oh, no.

00:07:20.606 --> 00:07:22.341 line:0%
-Someone doing
the Milk Crate Challenge.

00:07:22.341 --> 00:07:23.442 line:0%
-Oh.

00:07:23.442 --> 00:07:26.545 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:26.545 --> 00:07:28.814 line:0%
-This next one is
from Marvel and DC.

00:07:28.814 --> 00:07:30.383 line:0%
-Really?!
-They both wrote...

00:07:36.189 --> 00:07:37.523 line:0%
-Ooh.

00:07:37.523 --> 00:07:38.824 line:0%
-A Batman Popsicle

00:07:38.824 --> 00:07:42.562 line:0%
from some janky ice cream truck.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:42.562 --> 00:07:43.696 line:0%
-Yeah, sure, whatever, kid.

00:07:43.696 --> 00:07:45.297 line:0%
It's Batman.
-Hey, he's Batman, man.

00:07:45.297 --> 00:07:46.532 line:0%
[ Laughs ]

00:07:46.532 --> 00:07:49.502 line:0%
-Here's one
