00:07:49.502 --> 00:07:50.870 line:0%
-Ooh!
-They both wrote...

00:07:56.542 --> 00:07:57.677 line:0%
"Bachelor in Paradise."

00:07:57.677 --> 00:08:01.414 line:0%
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:08:01.414 --> 00:08:02.648 line:0%
This is the last one, here.

00:08:02.648 --> 00:08:05.751 line:0%
It's from Joe Biden and CVS.
They both wrote...

00:08:11.857 --> 00:08:14.527 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]
That's all the time we have
for "Picture This."

